<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/e2231bef-b5f6-4a91-9442-4d8a544a27a2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-06-29T19:18:51Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
