<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/88086cbf-ee8d-4436-b22f-f59c690d364e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Building, testing, or publishing the Rust crate requires rust/csrc/ to exist and be current — a fresh checkout's rust/ directory alone cannot build, since rust/csrc is gitignored and only populated by running `make crate-vendor` (or the crate-build/crate-test/crate-publish targets that depend on it) first." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
