<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/fe61d83c-d866-4161-8524-f494504f1b8b> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The W3C SHACL Core xfail list collapses from ~90 entries to 2 known gaps (targets/targetClassImplicit-001.ttl needing rdfs:subClassOf reasoning, and path/path-strange-002.ttl's ambiguous RDF-list/sh:inversePath path node) once sh:closed and sh:qualifiedValueShapesDisjoint are wired, per cli/tests/w3c/xfail.txt in this commit." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
