<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/4b7fe047-e517-4a87-a16e-56d88a55aed4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "The validation engine evaluates shapes against the data graph in a single-threaded, single pass — there is no fixpoint/iterative re-evaluation loop. Evidence: CLAUDE.md Conventions \"Single-threaded, single-pass validation (no fixpoint)\"." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
