<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/63078935-7e07-4eef-970b-780b0f11baaa> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Snarl validates SHACL Core constraints only and explicitly excludes SHACL-SPARQL (sh:sparql-based constraint components) from scope. Evidence: CLAUDE.md \"SHACL Core constraint validator... SHACL Core only — no SHACL-SPARQL.\"; README.md \"Implements SHACL Core constraints only (no SHACL-SPARQL).\"" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
