<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/75401fe7-6e13-4169-9d69-fdabeb1fdd7d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "As of this commit, a SHACL path node that simultaneously exhibits RDF-list structure and carries sh:inversePath is ambiguous and unsupported by path evaluation. Evidence: cli/tests/w3c/xfail.txt in commit b14fe6bfca792ae4b9799d14af7cb5235e4893b8 keeps `path/path-strange-002.ttl` xfailed with the comment \"Ambiguous path node with both RDF list structure and sh:inversePath\"." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
