<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/7f7625e1-e91a-4be5-858c-8cb24795e82e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Four-phase SHACL constraint roadmap" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/7f7625e1-e91a-4be5-858c-8cb24795e82e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/7f7625e1-e91a-4be5-858c-8cb24795e82e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Implementation of SHACL Core coverage is planned across four phases: Phase 1 — skeleton + basic constraints (types, parse, target, engine, value-type, cardinality, report, API, CLI); Phase 2 — remaining simple constraints (value-range, string, other, remaining targets); Phase 3 — complex constraints + paths (inverse/sequence/alternative paths, pair, logical, shape constraints, cycle detection); Phase 4 — advanced paths + polish (zero-or-more/one-or-more paths, regex, RDF report, full tests). Phase 1 is complete as of this commit (value-range, string, pair, logical, shape, and advanced-path constraints are not yet implemented); Phases 2-4 are planned. Evidence: CLAUDE.md \"Implementation Status\" checklist." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/7f7625e1-e91a-4be5-858c-8cb24795e82e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
